      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SCUDERIA (3) was favourite last start and led all the way, scoring by 2 lengths (34.93) at this track in a Restricted WIN over 600m. Great chance to get the job done again. VITESSE ETOILE (1) turned spotting a big start finishing fifth (30.81) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Should be in this for a long way. LAKEVIEW LIBBY (2) made light work of the tricky draw with a strong early sectional but swamped late when a close up fourth (35.19) at this track over 600m. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to her name from six starts. Expected to feature in the finish. BLACKJACK TABLE (8) placed last start at this track and distance and is in the mix again.",
